        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In December 2021, we filed a lawsuit seeking to overturn INPI’s decision denying registration of the INTER (word and design) trademark for financial services.",
        "start_character": 53109,
        "end_character": 53267
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000185",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000185-f2e8a29182fbd338",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000185",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some of our product highlights of 2025 were: (i) Private payroll, a new product in which we currently estimate to have approximately a 2.5% market share of the Brazilian portfolio, based on market data from Banco Central do Brasil, and is a product which we believe has a great capability of cross-selling, high margins and opportunities to expansion;",
        "start_character": 22144,
        "end_character": 22495
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000185",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000185-f2e8a29182fbd338",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000185",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Thus, we began to operate as a full service bank, by offering financing, investments, and real estate credit, under the name Banco Intermedium S.A.",
        "start_character": 722,
        "end_character": 869
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000185",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000185-f2e8a29182fbd338",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000185",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We aim to extend the capabilities we have developed in Brazil into new markets, including in the U.S., offering solutions for Brazilians who travel abroad and to US Residents.",
        "start_character": 4905,
        "end_character": 5080
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000185",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000185-f2e8a29182fbd338",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000185",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have an asset management platform, called Inter Asset, which provides mutual funds developed in-house and customized solutions, a capital markets platform for corporate clients, providing debt securities, trading, and custody services.",
