        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that we provide a wide range of products and services connected to our e-commerce that will allow us to retain our clients in the long run, such as: gift cards, food delivery, restaurant loyalty programs, cashback on gas refueling, cellphone plans, among others.",
