        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed what we believe to be a complete banking ecosystem, and, when considering to launch a new product, we conduct a thorough analysis to estimate our marginal expected return in relation to our expected research and development investment.",
